Title/card: cards/title_bg.png and cards/end_bg.png are 1280x720 sky-only derivatives, with no lettering. Display 0–2.5 s / 18–20 s; editor types title and “The End”. Both backgrounds use sky-only crops with a 16:9 aspect ratio. They are enlarged for typography and are not detailed scenery sources.

Narrative caveat: still photography implies the action. Shot 1 is before release, shot 2 just after release with hands open, and shot 3 away from the child. Within-shot movement is camera motion. The lantern remains on the water in all five scenes. Its left-trailing wake and successive framing establish the direction of travel.
